Subject: [PATCH] Ayaneo Pocket DS screen modes (dual / top only / bottom only)

Re-implements the stock Ayaneo framework support used by AYAHome's Dual Screen
panel: Settings.Global dual_display_mode (1 both screens, 3 top screen only,
4 bottom screen only = display swap), dual_display_pointer_mode, and the
locked_focus_display_id controller focus lock (the gamepad events go to the locked
display, see frameworks/native 0002-ayaneo-locked-gamepad-display.patch).
- top screen only: the bottom screen hosts no home (no relaunch loop);
- bottom screen only: the default display keeps the rotation of the bottom panel;
- displays enabled again by a mode change get the current power request at once;
- launches that do not tell their display open on the main screen.
Active only with ro.product.device.type=AR11.

