+    /**
+     * Ayaneo Pocket DS: display that keeps the input focus, set by the Ayaneo launcher in
+     * Settings.Global "locked_focus_display_id" (a display id, or "none"). Mirrored in
+     * persist.tc.locked_focus_display_id like the stock framework.
